                                                "sense_id": "e8f023ee-059e-306f-ac61-d209f8c78ddd",
                                                "text": "New-media gossip juggernaut Gawker also pays tribute to churnalism's animating spirits: shortness, sensationalism, superficiality, and speed."
                                            },
